{"parse": {"title": "FX-08", "pageid": 55393, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/FX-07\" title=\"FX-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">FX-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">FX</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.9D.B4.E8.9D.B6.E6.8C.AF.E7.BF.85.E4.B9.8B.E6.97.B6\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"蝴蝶振翅之时\">蝴蝶振翅之时</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 蝴蝶振翅之时</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Butterfly Flaps Its Wings</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>换<span class=\"color-value\"></span>上<span class=\"color-value\"></span>新<span class=\"color-value\"></span>装<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>褪<span class=\"color-value\"></span>去<span class=\"color-value\"></span>厚<span class=\"color-value\"></span>茧<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>他<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>身<span class=\"color-value\"></span>影<span class=\"color-value\"></span>终<span class=\"color-value\"></span>有<span class=\"color-value\"></span>重<span class=\"color-value\"></span>叠<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>那<span class=\"color-value\"></span>日<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 191108</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-gongmu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"gongmu\"><img alt=\"gongmu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/600px-Cg-gongmu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/900px-Cg-gongmu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/1200px-Cg-gongmu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>公墓中，罕有人迹的一角，小春雀儿伫立于此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面对一块仅余镌刻的无言石碑，无论曾经怎样动摇的情感，都会回归平静。仿若搁浅的鲸鱼被归还海洋一般的平静。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但波托马克河中实际没有鲸鱼。于是活人的心也将永远悬置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>“……这里到洛伦兹不算太远。”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>您听见了吗？刚才那个人说的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她蹲下去，把捧花扶起来重新靠好，又站起来。同样的动作她已经重复无数次，仍然不厌其烦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这种耐心在同龄人中相当少见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>他说，他曾是您的同事。你们曾经一起工作，就像是朋友那样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>就像马特和他的朋友……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>可我还是不明白。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>洛伦兹，或者拉普拉斯。那都是什么，是我应该去了解的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>如果我了解了，就能够这样踩着您留下的脚印前进吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我可以流畅地背出童子军手册，但是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我好像并不是一个值得您骄傲的孩子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>几日前的“失败”出现在脑海中。小春雀儿晃了晃脑袋。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>好吧。前几天，我和母亲都还在布鲁克林的时候……我遇到了另一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>他……唔。刚才是不是已经说过这个了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>他也问了我一个问题，当时我不知道怎么回答。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>他问我，“想不想看看别的路怎么走？”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>和刚才那位先生说的话，很相似……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>可我不知道，父亲。我还是不知道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>但也许，也许我总会明白的，对不对？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她把绶带的陈旧布料捏在手中，抬起头，目光紧紧盯住眼前的墓碑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>一定是这样的。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_bg_xiaoxiang_ye\"><img alt=\"1_9_bg_xiaoxiang_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-1_9_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png/600px-Cg-1_9_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-1_9_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png/900px-Cg-1_9_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Cg-1_9_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_bg_xiaoxiang_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>下城区的街道上，小春雀儿匆匆穿行而过，将自己藏进灰砖墙与铁栅栏之间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一条通往旅馆的最快捷路线。母女两人来到河的对岸探亲，她落脚之后的第一件事，就是摸清了周围街区环境和出行路线。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为了保护自己，更为了保护母亲。对这些事她向来做得很好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-300601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-300601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-300601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>拐过去，还有半个街区……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-300601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-300601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-300601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……快点……得再快点——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-300601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-300601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f8/HeadIconSmall-300601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>回去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>闪烁的思绪之间，她在隐约的人声中推开旅馆房门。放下的脚步也轻缓，又轻缓。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-lvguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"lvguan\"><img alt=\"lvguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/600px-Cg-lvguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/900px-Cg-lvguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-lvguan.png/1200px-Cg-lvguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"504201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"504201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ef/HeadIconSmall-504201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-504201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……是更合适的去处。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我回来了——妈妈？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>噢，嗨。不是你妈妈，但，我们又见面啦～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>X先生！你怎么会在这里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我说了，“回头见”，记得吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>先进去换件衣服吧，孩子。你又在墓园呆得忘了时间，肩膀都被露水打湿了。下次，我说什么都要跟你一起去才行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>对不起，妈妈……但有件事，我想问问您的意见……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>至少先去擦擦头发吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>妈妈，我今天在那里遇见了一个人……他说他曾经与父亲共事过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>您会认识他吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话语间，小春雀儿看向Ｘ。短暂的视线相对之后，年长的男孩两指交替，在空中比划出一个简单的溜走动作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但女孩只是盯着，随即坚定地摇了摇头。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>傻孩子，我不清楚他的模样，又要怎样确认呢？但他能认出你，也许真的是你父亲的老朋友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>不过，你一个人外出，还是需要对陌生人提高警惕——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>他告诉我说，父亲曾经不仅仅隶属于军队。他还提到了一个叫洛伦兹的地方……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>虽然我不知道那是哪里，但……我是不是也不一定要成为童子军？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>孩子，我对你唯一的期望就是健康和快乐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>我会支持你的所有决定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>嗯？虽然不知道你今天还遇见了谁，但听上去像是我的同事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>不过这都不重要，你可以将我的建议当作那个话题的延伸。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>——要不要和我一起回拉普拉斯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>我不知道……拉普拉斯，和洛伦兹，它们都是什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>你们能接受女孩的加入吗？那位先生和你，看上去都是男孩……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>哦，我们可没有那么多的条条框框，就算你不是女孩，也不是男孩，甚至都没什么所谓——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>扯远了，总之你可以简单把它们当成同一个地方的不同组织。如果你愿意，我可以之后再更详细地为你介绍一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……但父亲不在了，我应该更照顾母亲。我不能一直留在这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>但你的母亲说，你们已经在为搬过来做准备了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>我想离你的父亲，也和我的姐妹们更近点。虽然我还是无法直面那个墓碑——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">母亲：</div><div>但总有一天我会的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>但是……为什么是我？我不出众，也不能完美地完成任务……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我没有说过吗？你是一个很称职的助手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>并且你之前还成功找到了“Ｘ”，不管是哪个。这说明你有很敏锐的观察和搜寻能力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>综上所述，我认为你的素质远超那群过家家的童子军，需要一个远比童子军协会更有意思、更适合你的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>——？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>所以……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>我带来了另一条路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>啊，这是……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_9_at_ys_xiaochunqueer.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_9_at_ys_xiaochunqueer\"><img alt=\"1_9_at_ys_xiaochunqueer\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Cg-1_9_at_ys_xiaochunqueer.png/600px-Cg-1_9_at_ys_xiaochunqueer.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Cg-1_9_at_ys_xiaochunqueer.png/900px-Cg-1_9_at_ys_xiaochunqueer.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f1/Cg-1_9_at_ys_xiaochunqueer.png/1200px-Cg-1_9_at_ys_xiaochunqueer.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>一件制服……和你的很相似——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>这是一件真正的制服？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>是啊。这就是“另一条路”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>这是洛伦兹研究所的制服。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">小春雀儿：</div><div>洛伦兹，另一条路……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>没错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>毕竟，我认为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/96/HeadIconSmall-301001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>你应该寻找的不是一只小狗，而是一只蝴蝶。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "FX-08"}}